          %p
            (along the lines of
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/Quantization+via+Linear+homotopy+types"} Schreiber 14
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/master+thesis+Nuiten"} Nuiten 13
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                with parametrized stable homotopy theory understood as twisted cohomology theory as in
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "twisted+cohomology#ABG10"} Ando, Blumberg &amp; Gepner 10
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "#twisted+cohomology#ABGHR14"} Ando, Blumberg, Gepner &amp; Hopkins 14
                = succeed ";" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/The+Character+Map+in+Twisted+Non-Abelian+Cohomology"} Fiorenza, Sati, Schreiber 20
            %li
              %p
                with dependent linear homotopy type theory understood as, e.g., in
                %a{:href => "dependent+linear+type+theory#RileyFinsterLicata21"} Riley, Finster &amp; Licata 21
                following
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/differential+cohomology+in+a+cohesive+topos"} Schreiber 13
                = succeed ";" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/pdf/1310.7930v1.pdf#page=446"} Prop. 4.1.9
            %li
              %p
                with classically controlled quantum computation seen as dependent linear type theory, as stated fully explicitly in
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "quantum+programming+language#FKS20"} Fu, Kishida &amp; Selinger 20
                %a{:href => "quantum+programming+language#FKRS20"} Fu, Kishida, Ross &amp; Selinger 20
                and more tentatively before in
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "dependent+linear+type+theory#Vakar14"} Vakar 14
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "dependent+linear+type+theory#Vakar15"} Vakar 15
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "dependent+linear+type+theory#Vakar17"} Vakar 17
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/Quantization+via+Linear+homotopy+types"} Schreiber 14
